!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = The total RNA samples of three pairs of bladder cancer and normal bladder tissues were treated with the RiboZero rRNA Removal Kit and  RNase R for deleting rRNA and linear RNA, according to the manufacturer’s instructions.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = The rRNA depleted and RNase R digested RNA samples were fragmented and synthesized cDNA with random primer. Purified the PCR amplification products of cDNA, then the libraries were quality controlled and sequenced by HiSeq2000 (Illumina).
!Sample_description = circRNA_expression.xls header = zhangyuanpingT
!Sample_data_processing = Illumina Casava 1.8 software used for basecalling.
!Sample_data_processing = Sequenced reads were trimmed for adaptor sequence, and masked for low-complexity or low-quality sequence using Seqtk and Perl version 5.8.8
!Sample_data_processing = Sequenced reads were aligned to the hg38 genome assembly using BWA version 0.7.10 with parameters: -t 8 -k 19
!Sample_data_processing = CircRNA predicted and junction reads measurements were analysed using CIRI version 1.2 with parameters: -P --high-strigency
!Sample_data_processing = Differential expression were analysed  using edgeR function package in R program version 3.10.0
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: ensembl hg38
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: tab-delimited text files include normalized SRPBM values and raw fragment counts for each Sample
